<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Youssef Mohamed Salman | Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f5fa;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #315b78;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 15px;
        }

        section {
            background-color: white;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #315b78;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #dce8f0;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .skill {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #e2edf5;
            color: #315b78;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            margin: 5px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        a {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #315b78;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        a:hover {
            background-color: #24465e;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            color: #666;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            section {
                margin: 15px;
                padding: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Youssef Mohamed Salman</h1>
        <p>Computer and Information Student</p>
        <p>Suez Canal University</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hello! My name is Youssef Mohamed Salman.
            I am a second-year student at the Faculty of
            Computers and Information, Suez Canal University.
        </p>
        <p>
            I am interested in learning programming and
            improving my web development skills.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>My Skills</h2>
        <span class="skill">HTML</span>
        <span class="skill">CSS</span>
        <span class="skill">Java</span>
        <span class="skill">Problem Solving</span>
        <span class="skill">Basic Programming</span>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>My Assignments</h2>
        <p>
            You can view my assignments using the link below.
        </p>

        <a href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RBYsy8rs10bu1H0pIVr47imbB20tgY56?usp=drive_link"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            View Assignments
        </a>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>Youssef Mohamed Salman - 2026</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
